── section · tenancies ──
> + add a tenancy   paste a GitLab group or repo link, or its path  {add}
  ● b    team-b  0 repos · 0 hidden  {tenancy:0:["acme","team-b"]}
  ● a    team-a  4 repos · 1 hidden  {tenancy:0:["acme","team-a"]}
    api  shown  {tenancy:0:["acme","team-a"]/api}
    docs  shown  {tenancy:0:["acme","team-a"]/docs}
