    web  shown  {tenancy:0:["acme","team-a"]/web}
── detail · add a tenancy ──
Track another GitLab group (every repo in it), or one repo on its own.

PASTE OR TYPE ANY OF
  https://gitlab.com/<base>/tenants/<group>/
  /<part of base>/tenants/<group>/
  tenants/<group>
  a repo's link, or <group>/<repo>

Paths are taken under the base group acme.
radar offers to check it with GitLab once added; the check says whether it is a group or a repo.
── status · SETTINGS ──
b bulk  +/- expand/collapse  q quit  x extra actions  ~ notices  ←→↑↓ navigate
